# "wide bass" then "sub stack" (bass track): low notes with the side high-pass and the triangle sub; P2 swept
# into the sub range and back.
tempo 124
steps 16
tail 1.5
track bass
preset 100 220 0 80 160 30 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p2 192 255 0 8
sweep p2 255 160 8 16
note 0 A1 2 127
note 2 A1 1 90
note 4 C2 2 127
note 6 E1 2 110
note 8 G1 2 127
note 10 A1 1 80
note 12 D2 3 127
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 28
expect peak_below -4
